# Orchestrator UI

Follow `docs/tech/0004-frontend.md`. The page calls the API. It does not decide status.

- No `+server.ts`, no `hooks.server.ts`, no `{@html}`, no React.
- Render a button only when `actions` contains its name. Do not also branch on `status`.
- `sessionStorage` stores the bearer and the selected project id. Empty secret fields are omitted from JSON and never logged. Do not store a password or a GitHub token.
- On `401`, clear the bearer and go to `/login`. On `409`, reload. On network failure, say the API is unreachable. Do not invent cards. Login is email and password.
- One primary button per page. `.danger` only for blocked. Keep focus outlines. Controls are at least 44px tall. The shell is Marauder, styled with Tailwind from `src/app.css`.

```svelte
<!-- BAD -->
{#if card.status === 'human_review'}
  <button>Approve SHA</button>
{/if}

<!-- GOOD -->
{#if card.actions.includes('approve')}
  <button type="submit">Approve SHA</button>
{/if}
```
